ied')) ?></p></section></section><aside class="request-response-card"><span>Requested by</span><h2><?= e($request['requester_name']) ?><?= $request['marketplace_verified']?' ✓':'' ?></h2><p>Offer equipment you own using its existing Nonagon record. Submitted commercial terms are versioned and preserved.</p><a class="market-button" href="requests?view=respond&id=<?= e($request['id']) ?>">Respond to Request</a></aside></main><?php endif;?>
